 "text": "The Assembly directory lists 26 women-reserved members and four minority-reserved members. Reserved seats have no geographic constituency; their WR/MR identifiers identify the seats. No other reserved category appears in the provincial roster. Term-start dates are recorded oath dates; the 2025 entrants took office after the reserved-seat reallocation, not through constituency by-elections."
